---
// About statement slide: cream ground. The lemonade-stand line opens small
// in the editorial serif, then the wordmark sentence and the "A new space"
// beat speak in the display sans. The red wordmark is the only other
// accent. The floating product art was cut once the type went
// display-scale (Aug 21 review): the beats need the full column.
---

<section class="fc-newspace" id="about" aria-labelledby="newspace-title">
  <p class="eyebrow-line">The modern lemonade stand for the next generation.</p>

  <h2 class="statement" id="newspace-title">
    <span class="line line-1">
      <!-- Brand wordmark in red stands in for the word "Stand" (same paths as
           the footer logo); the sr-only span keeps the sentence readable to
           assistive tech. -->
      <span class="visually-hidden">Stand</span>
      <svg class="logo-word" viewBox="0 0 199.29 47.33" aria-hidden="true">
