      </svg>
      is where kids create,
    </span>
    <span class="line line-2">build and grow real businesses.</span>
  </h2>

  <p class="tagline">
    A new space for learning entrepreneurial skills. Designed for kids with
    big ideas.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .fc-newspace {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: left;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    /* Same 1132px column + 48px gutters as the manifesto above. */
    padding: var(--space-6) 48px;
    max-width: calc(1132px + 2 * 48px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    /* Cream is the page ground — the slide rides on it, no band color. */
  }

  /* The serif opener, small and quiet. */
  .eyebrow-line {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--stand-black);
  }

  /* The two display beats share one voice, left-aligned. */
  .tagline,
  .statement {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--stand-black);
  }

  .line {
    display: block;
  }

  /* Red wordmark inline with the sentence, scaled to the type's cap height. */
  .logo-word {
    display: inline-block;
    height: 0.74em;
    width: auto;
    fill: var(--stand-red);
    vertical-align: baseline;
    transform: translateY(0.02em);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fc-newspace {
      padding: var(--space-7) 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
